## PART D — TESTING CHECKLIST (before any client agent goes live)

Run every item as a real test call before the agent touches a live caller:

- [ ] Agent answers and greets with the correct business name and agent name
- [ ] Agent states hours correctly and knows when the business is closed
- [ ] Agent answers 3 common FAQs accurately from the knowledge base
- [ ] Agent does NOT invent a price, guarantee, or hour that isn't in the KB
- [ ] Agent captures caller name naturally
- [ ] Agent asks for and reads back the callback number
- [ ] Caller detail logs to the CRM correctly
- [ ] Agent books a test appointment into the correct calendar
- [ ] Confirmation flow fires (booking confirmation text/email)
- [ ] Agent escalates correctly on an emergency-type request
- [ ] Agent escalates correctly when the caller asks for a person
- [ ] Agent handles an unknown question with capture-and-route (no guessing)
- [ ] Agent does NOT push promotions or ask to "send marketing details"
- [ ] Agent stays gracious when a competitor is mentioned
- [ ] After-hours behavior works as configured
- [ ] Voice, pace, and humor level match the client's brand

